      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Certainty vs Doubt</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Lesson 11 — Manson's Law of Avoidance</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"170\" width=\"940\" height=\"230\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"225\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">The Law of Avoidance</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"285\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">The more something threatens your identity, the</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"325\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">more you will avoid it — without even noticing.</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"375\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#888\">Certainty feels like safety; it functions like a cage.</text><rect x=\"70\" y=\"430\" width=\"460\" height=\"290\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.15)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"485\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Certain You Are Smart</text><text x=\"100\" y=\"545\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Avoid challenges that</text><text x=\"100\" y=\"585\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#ffffff\">could expose a gap.</text><text x=\"100\" y=\"640\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#ffffff\">A bad grade is a</text><text x=\"100\" y=\"680\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#ffffff\">threat to defend against.</text><rect x=\"570\" y=\"430\" width=\"460\" height=\"290\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"800\" y=\"485\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Uncertain You Are Smart</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"545\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Nothing to defend,</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"585\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#ffffff\">everything to learn.</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"640\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#ffffff\">A bad grade is data,</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"680\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#ffffff\">not a verdict.</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"760\" width=\"900\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.15)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"815\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">What This Lesson Covers</text><text x=\"140\" y=\"865\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#ffffff\">1. Why certainty seduces  2. How the law operates</text><text x=\"140\" y=\"905\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#ffffff\">3. Working doubt vs paralysis  4. Practice: hold beliefs loosely</text></svg>",
